          "description": "Make counting fun with engaging stories, catchy songs, and movement activities! Kids will learn to count to 10, 20, 50, 100, and 1000 while building confidence in numbers. They’ll also practice skip counting by 5s, 10s, and 100s through fun challenges. With storytelling, music, and interactive play, this audio keeps kids excited about learning. Perfect for ages 3-7, it’s a playful way to develop early math skills at home or on the go. Let’s count together! Most icons by Heather Ambrosio!",
